{"id":"af4bf41c645962b1","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-craig-lambda.md","title":"Craig's Lemma","display":"Craig's Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-craig-lambda","aliases":["93-thm-craig-lambda"],"display":"Craig's Lemma","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-deduction]]","[[93-df-interpolant]]","[[93-df-craig-interpolation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-craig-lambda"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-craig-lambda</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Craig's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7480655210b09b5d\" href=\"?note=7480655210b09b5d\" title=\"93-df-deduction\">93-df-deduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f7efc342a84d366e\" href=\"?note=f7efc342a84d366e\" title=\"93-df-interpolant\">93-df-interpolant</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eda3df85f724c1ae\" href=\"?note=eda3df85f724c1ae\" title=\"93-df-craig-interpolation\">93-df-craig-interpolation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-craig-lambda-—-Craig's-Lemma\">thm-craig-lambda — Craig's Lemma</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}),\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}),\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> is the sourced type-indexed interpolant predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f7efc342a84d366e\" href=\"?note=f7efc342a84d366e\" title=\"93-df-interpolant\">93-df-interpolant</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}lambda}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}),\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\;\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}lambda}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}),\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\;\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The conclusion holds for logics with Craig interpolation; it is not a theorem of every consequence relation. The interpolant uses only variables common to both endpoint formulas.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-craig-lambda-—-Craig's-Lemma","text":"thm-craig-lambda — Craig's Lemma","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"7480655210b09b5d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-deduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-interpolant","status":"resolved","id":"f7efc342a84d366e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-interpolant]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"eda3df85f724c1ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-craig-interpolation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-interpolant","status":"resolved","id":"f7efc342a84d366e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ is the sourced type-indexed interpolant predicate of [[93-df-interpolant]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}),\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}lambda}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}),\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\;\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1298,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["bd7e4207897c8db3","c2ca1af9af149e69","7480655210b09b5d","f7efc342a84d366e","eda3df85f724c1ae"]}